  "solution": {
    "text": "Applying <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> property in <math><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo></math> we get <math><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow></mrow></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Adding both, we get&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math>"
  }
